# bail-processing-algorithms

The bail processing system implements domain-specific workflows for handling defendant verification and compliance:

## Core Components

### Compliance Check-in Workflow
- Location-based compliance verification for defendants on bail
- Multi-factor authentication combining GPS data and photo verification 
- Automated timestamp and geolocation validation
- Compliance attempt tracking with refusal monitoring

### Bond Status Processing
- Automated bond eligibility determination
- SMS-based compliance notification delivery
- Time-limited verification tokens for compliance actions
- Provider fallback system for notification delivery

### Location Monitoring
- Geographic compliance zone enforcement
- Last known location tracking with accuracy metrics
- Administrative oversight tools for compliance verification
- Audit trail generation for verification attempts

## Integration Points

### SMS Integration
- Multi-provider messaging system supporting SMS, WhatsApp, and MMS
- Idempotent message delivery guarantees
- Automated follow-up queue management

### Token Generation
- One-time secure check-in link creation
- Time-bounded verification windows
- Compliance action authorization

